name decimalcomma
category Package
revision 69251
shortdesc Comma for decimal numbers
relocated 1
longdesc This small package offers a new definition of the comma ',' as
longdesc an active character. It ensures the correct spacing in
longdesc mathematical mode when using the comma either as a decimal
longdesc separator or as a list separator. With this package, the comma
longdesc behaves similarly to ncccomma, but the code is lighter, and
longdesc several compatibility issues have been fixed.
runfiles size=1
 RELOC/tex/latex/decimalcomma/decimalcomma.sty
catalogue-ctan /macros/latex/contrib/decimalcomma
catalogue-license lppl1.3
catalogue-topics maths numbers typesetting
catalogue-version 1.4
